    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop are delighted to present 34 Finn Street to the Stoneybatter market.  Ideally located in the heart of this much sought-after and vibrant Dublin 7 neighbourhood, this charming two-storey home offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a lovingly maintained property in a truly superb location. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out over two floors and comprises a welcoming living room, dining room kitchenette and full bathroom all located at ground floor level. Upstairs there are two comfortable double bedrooms. There is on-street residents` parking is available to the front.\r\n\r\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property`s greatest attractions. Finn Street is within easy walking distance of the bustling heart of Stoneybatter, where an excellent selection of independent cafés, restaurants, bars, local shops and everyday amenities can be found. The area is renowned for its strong community atmosphere and has become one of Dublin`s most desirable places to live.\r\n\r\nThe beautiful Phoenix Park is also just a short stroll away, while Smithfield Village, Phibsborough and Dublin City Centre are all within easy walking distance. The property is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, as well as the Luas and Heuston Station providing convenient access to the city and beyond.\r\n\r\nNo. 34 Finn Street is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a charming and well-maintained home in a fantastic Stoneybatter location. With its attractive two-storey layout, character, excellent condition and superb setting, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and those seeking a home in one of Dublin`s most popular neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through our Manor Street office.\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch 0.9m (2'11\") x 1.06m (3'6\")\r\nThrough original hardwood front door and leading to...\r\n\r\nLiving Room 4.19m (13'9\") x 4.04m (13'3\")\r\nLocated to the front of the property with original wood flooring, wood burning stove, high ceilings and built in shelving.\r\n\r\nDining Room 2.88m (9'5\") x 3.09m (10'2\")\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with built in storage shelving.\r\n\r\nKitchenette 1.53m (5'0\") x 2.46m (8'1\")\r\nLocated to the rear of the property, just off the dining room. Plumbed for laundry.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 2.64m (8'8\") x 3.65m (12'0\")\r\nSpacious double bedroom located to the front of the property with original wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 2.75m (9'0\") x 2.96m (9'9\")\r\nDouble bedroom located to the rear of the property with original hardwood flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.33m (7'8\") x 1.47m (4'10\")\r\nFull bathroom located on the ground floor to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nAREA \r\nApprox. 63 Sq.m / 678 Sq.ft"
      },
